  "summary": "Cell C6 loads the /tmp/A.npy cube written by C5 (1991-12-27 to 2003-08-31, the full 60x60 region). It builds per-cell hazen 90th-percentile pools of \u00b15 days, sets day 60 by interpolation, applies a wrapped 31-day smoothing, and compares June\u2013August 2003 SST against the smoothed threshold; the target days use thresholds for day-of-year 138\u2013259, so their pools draw on 12 May\u201320 Sep of each baseline year. It then runs per-cell run detection and gap joining on sea cells and writes mh to output/mhw_mask.nc; the climatology is never used."
